  "description": "From Tapas:  \nYeongji always dreamed of having the perfect love story. Singing songs under cherry blossom trees, laughing till crying, texting till falling asleep, you know, nabbing the kinda guy who would do the cheesy stuff. Little did she expect the one to be a guy with an avatar of a goldfish in panties she met online. These are the quirky diaries of a not so perfect, but still perfect, love story.\n\n[Official English](https://tapas.io/series/yeongjisdiary/info)\n\n*Original Webcomic is uploaded on creator's SNS*",
